Committees of Red Aid are formed in every district: lawyers for the accused, parcels for the prisoners, money for their families. Many of the families are not communists. Some become communists.

@distance
subtitle: Respectable. Central Germany will not like it.
on-arrival: spd_relation += 2; district_halle_loyalty -= 6; offensive_satisfaction -= 5; luxemburgist_satisfaction += 2

The Rote Fahne reports the sentence in a short notice on page three.
